The frpc engine (`androidApp/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libfrpc.so`) is compiled
from the official frp source tree using `scripts/build-frpc.sh` with:

    CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=android GOARCH=arm64 go build -trimpath -ldflags "-s -w" -tags frpc

No modifications are made to the frp source code. The only build-time adjustment
is providing `web/frpc/dist` (the official dashboard, built from the same
source tree with `npm run build-only`) so that the `go:embed` directive resolves;
the resulting assets are shipped unmodified.

The bundled engine version is recorded in `androidApp/src/main/assets/frpc/VERSION`.
